[{"_1":2},"routes/docs-slug",{"_3":4},"data",{"_5":6,"_7":8},"content","# Installation\n\nNovellis is currently in **Early Access**. You can download the latest version from our GitHub repository.\n\n## Download Latest Version\n\nVisit the [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/byteyilabs/novellis-app/releases) page to find the installer for your operating system.\n\n## Security & Signing\n\nNovellis is currently in Early Access, and our binaries are **unsigned**. This may trigger warnings from your operating system during installation.\n\n### macOS (Gatekeeper)\nIf you see a message saying Novellis \"cannot be opened because the developer cannot be verified\":\n1. Open your **Applications** folder.\n2. **Right-click** (or Control-click) the Novellis app.\n3. Select **Open** from the menu.\n4. Click **Open** in the dialog box that appears.\n\n### Windows (SmartScreen)\nIf Windows SmartScreen prevents the app from starting:\n1. Click **More info**.\n2. Click **Run anyway**.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Make sure to check the [System Requirements](requirements.md) section before installing to ensure the best performance for local AI models.\n","slug","installation"]
